      "message": "[error] Line 159: 🔴 `ExternalMediaDemotionReady` is emitted while `callMutex_` is still held in `completeExternalMediaDemotion()`. Signal dispatch is synchronous, so a client callback that re-enters call APIs can block on the same mutex and deadlock the call thread. Capture the data under lock, release `callMutex_`, then emit the signal outside the critical section (same pattern as promotion ready/failure reporting).",
